    "message": "Hello! This is the first release of the Belasco Heavy Industries DH-139 Ferry! If you have played the port escape scenario, this is the model from that. It has a functional jbeam, pathways you can walk on, an interior camera, a working(but glitchy) ramp, and working propellers!(thanks to [USER=390433]@Agent_Y[\/USER] )\nThere are currently 2 configurations, the \"Base\" model, and the \"Cargo\" model. for the moment, you can only have up to 2 cargo containers on the boat, as trying to add more will start breaking stuff. \n\nTop speed of about 12mph.\nDual props\n\nYou can sink the ferry by using \"break all breakgroups\"\n\nCREDITS: Model:BeamNG. Jbeam: JGB. Propellers: [USER=390433]@Agent_Y[\/USER] \n\nPlease send me feedback and bug reports!\nI would also love to see screen shots!\n\nIf you would like to support me, or gain early access to some other mods, check out my patreon!\n[URL]https:\/\/www.patreon.com\/jgbmods\/[\/URL]",
